#==============================================================================================
#
#   block_formatting_context_1 - Layout::BlockFormattingContext: construction, the margin
#                                state, running the context and its automatic sizes
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/BlockFormattingContext.cpp (lines 1-183) and the inline members of
#       BlockFormattingContext.h: the collapsible margin state (BlockMarginState), the float
#       side data, the constructor and the destructor (which lays out absolutely positioned
#       children its parent never asked for), the automatic content sizes, whether margins
#       collapse through a box, run, positioning floats once the root box is dimensioned, and
#       which boxes avoid floats.
